        <item quantity="one">That one goo goes for good — its strokes, keyframes, levers and the photo behind them. Pictures you already saved from Out stay in your gallery.</item>
        <item quantity="other">All %1$d goos go for good — their strokes, keyframes, levers and the photos behind them. Pictures you already saved from Out stay in your gallery.</item>
    </plurals>

