    <string name="about_title" translatable="false">Meltorama 2000 %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_body">Squish, smear and stretch your photos like wet paint — a loving homage to Kai\'s Power Goo (1996), in the retro-future livery it always deserved. Fully offline: no permissions, no network, nothing leaves your device.\n\nBuilt almost entirely by LLM agents. Public domain (Unlicense). Unaffiliated with the rights holders of Kai\'s Power Goo or KPT.</string>
